  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hello! \ud83d\udc4b Welcome to Fooda Naija!\n\nI'm your personal food ordering assistant. I can help you:\n\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Browse restaurants in your city\n\ud83d\udccb View menus and prices\n\ud83d\uded2 Place orders for delivery\n\nWhich city are you ordering from? (Lagos, Abuja, Port Harcourt, Ibadan, Kano, or Enugu)",
